Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:10:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 67/68] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: telephoto OIS and
 binned camera modes

New kernel patches:
0152 lets an LC898128 run as a slave that gets the gyroscope data from
another one, 0153 adds the telephoto OIS to the OnePlus 8 Pro device
tree, 0154 and 0155 add 2000x1500 4x4 binned modes to the IMX689 and
IMX586 drivers (60 fps preview instead of 30), 0156 gives the telephoto
sensor its actuator supply.
